# DRIFTLINE: the drive as written. Four stages of fixed, hand-placed
# waves, each reaching its boss after the same stretch of road; three
# bonus stages of 18, 20 and 22 blocks; bosses worth 10,000 to 40,000.
# The cherry's arithmetic: shooting down every foe and every boss with one
# bonus stage, however well played, stays under 300,000; with two bonus
# stages it is within reach (as on the original, where 300,000 takes two
# or three bonus stages).
game driftline
wait 5
expect plan_foes1 == 129
expect plan_foes2 == 91
expect plan_foes3 == 72
expect plan_foes4 == 99
expect plan_points1 == 24400
expect plan_points2 == 24525
expect plan_points3 == 28750
expect plan_points4 == 31600
expect plan_boss_t1 == 8700
expect plan_boss_t4 == 8700
expect plan_blocks1 == 18
expect plan_blocks2 == 20
expect plan_blocks3 == 22
expect cherry_one_bonus_max < 300000
expect cherry_two_bonus_min >= 300000
print cherry_one_bonus_max
print cherry_two_bonus_min
# the same waves every time: two runs see the same first foes
wait 12
press A
wait 400
expect foes == 7
expect foes_0 == 4
expect foes_1 == 3
